ame on the people for what they have earned, He would not leave upon it [i.e., the earth] any creature. But He defers them for a specified term. And when their time comes, then indeed Allāh has ever been, of His servants, Seeing.","j":22,"h":44,"s":35,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"36:1","t":"Yā, Seen.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"36:2","t":"By the wise Qur’ān,","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"36:3","t":"Indeed you, [O Muḥammad], are from among the messengers,","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"36:4","t":"On a straight path.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"36:5","t":"[This is] a revelation of the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"36:6","t":"That you may warn a people whose forefathers were not warned, so they are unaware.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"36:7","t":"Already the word [i.e., decree] has come into effect upon most of them, so they do not believe.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"36:8","t":"Indeed, We have put shackles on their necks, and they are to their chins, so they are with heads [kept] aloft.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"36:9","t":"And We have put before them a barrier and behind them a barrier and covered them, so they do not see.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"36:10","t":"And it is all the same for them whether you warn them or do not warn them - they will not believe.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"36:11","t":"You can only warn one who follows the message and fears the Most Merciful unseen. So give him good tidings of forgiveness and noble reward.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"36:12","t":"Indeed, it is We who bring the dead to life and record what they have put forth and what they left behind, and all things We have enumerated in a clear register.","j":22,"h":44,"s":36,"a":12,"sd":null}],"juz":22,"hizb":44,"surahs":[35,36],"sajdah":false}